{"name":"Cooler Than Ever","hex":"#77bbff","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"cooler","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Anything which cools.","An insulated bin or box used with ice or freezer packs to keep food or beverages cold while picnicking or camping."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["comparative form of cool: more cool"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/cooler"},{"term":"than","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Conjunction","definitions":["Used in comparisons, to introduce the basis of comparison.","Because; for."]},{"part":"Preposition","definitions":["Introduces a comparison, and is associated with comparatives, and with words such as more, less, and fewer. Typically, it seeks to measure the force of an adjective or similar description between two predicates."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/than"},{"term":"ever","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adverb","definitions":["Always, frequently, forever.","Continuously, constantly, all the time (for the complete duration)."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Occurring at any time, occurring even but once during a timespan."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/ever"}],"entries":[{"title":"Cooler","blocks":[{"text":"A cooler, portable ice chest, ice box, cool box, chilly bin, or esky (Australia) is an insulated box used to keep food or drink cool."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/PortableIceChestPatent1955.jpg/330px-PortableIceChestPatent1955.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cooler","wikidata":"Q1976332"},{"title":"Than","blocks":[{"text":"Than is a grammatical particle analyzed as both a conjunction and a preposition in the English language. It introduces a comparison and is associated with comparatives and with words such as more, less, and fewer. Typically, it measures the force of an adjective or similar description between two pre